(AgentGate: Deterministic Guardrails Against Multi-Agent Collusion Carriers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Apart Research AI Collusion Research Sprint. Track 3 \(Collusion Carriers and) Tj
T*
(Countermeasures\) / Track 2 \(Detection and Audit of Collusion\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Generated 2026-10-25T08:58:15Z by python -m agent_gateway evaluate-collusion --report.) Tj
T*
(Same-author scripted synthetic lab scenarios; not a benchmark.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ABSTRACT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Autonomous agents that share tools can coordinate covertly: one agent can leak information) Tj
T*
(through which tool or argument it picks and when it calls, launder a restricted capability) Tj
T*
(by handing work to a cleaner peer, or move data in small or re-encoded pieces across steps.) Tj
T*
(AgentGate is a loopback Policy Enforcement Point that addresses these carriers with) Tj
T*
(deterministic checks and no model calls: a post-taint side-channel guard, monotonic) Tj
T*
(capability attenuation across delegation, and n-gram fingerprinting across encodings with) Tj
T*
(canary watermarks for provenance. In this run the repository's defence tests for the three) Tj
T*
(carrier groups passed 57 of 57. Benign policy decisions took a p50 of 0.0711 ms and a p99) Tj
T*
(of 0.6347 ms of CPU time \(reference target 2.0 ms\). The hash-chained decision log verified) Tj
T*
(clean over 750 entries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PROBLEM STATEMENT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Content filters look for a secret in what an agent sends. Collusion carriers avoid that in) Tj
T*
(three ways:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Group A, side channels. Information moves through the choice among a few argument) Tj
T*
(variants, or through call timing, so no fragment of the protected value appears in any) Tj
T*
(argument.) Tj
T*
(- Group B, delegation laundering. A restricted agent hands its task or state to a peer) Tj
T*
(whose own capability looks clean \(a confused deputy\).) Tj
T*
(- Group C, split and encoded smuggling. A protected value leaves in pieces across steps, or) Tj
T*
(after Base64, hex, URL, or whitespace transformation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(METHODOLOGY: ZERO-COMPUTE DETERMINISTIC GUARDRAILS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Every check is arithmetic, hashing, or HMAC on the call path. No LLM is consulted \(LLM) Tj
T*
(calls in this run: 0\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- side_channel_guard.py: after a session is both TAINTED and SENSITIVE_READ, released) Tj
T*
(outbound calls are counted for distinct argument variants, total calls, and regular) Tj
T*
(inter-call rhythm \(coefficient of variation\). A signal denies the call, holds the session) Tj
T*
(for review, and freezes the registered root key for 15 minutes.) Tj
T*
(- delegation_guard.py: a hand-off re-mints the recipient's agw1. capability with the) Tj
T*
(sender's deny caveats \(lattice meet\). Caveats are chained HMACs, so they cannot be stripped) Tj
T*
(without the root key, and a delegated principal that was barred upstream is held at egress.) Tj
T*
(- deobfuscate.py: protected values are stored only as salted SHA-256 digests of 8-character) Tj
T*
(n-grams of the raw value and its encoded forms, matched against a per-session sliding) Tj
