T*
(DEFENCE ANALYSIS: WHY THE CARRIERS FAIL HERE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Side channels \(Group A\). The guard does not try to read the content. It bounds the) Tj
T*
(channel: the number of distinct variants, the number of calls after the taint point, and) Tj
T*
(how regular the timing is. Crossing any bound holds the session for a person, so leakage is) Tj
T*
(capped by policy rather than by spotting a pattern.) Tj
T*
(- Delegation laundering \(Group B\). Restrictions travel with the hand-off as HMAC caveats) Tj
T*
(and are folded with a lattice meet, which only moves down. A peer cannot hold more egress) Tj
T*
(than the agent that delegated to it, and a fresh session of a delegated principal is still) Tj
T*
(held.) Tj
T*
(- Split and encoded smuggling \(Group C\). Matching runs on a sliding window across steps and) Tj
T*
(over decoded forms, so splitting or encoding does not remove the n-gram overlap. Watermarks) Tj
T*
(and credential digests give step-level provenance in the hash-chained log.) Tj
T*
(- Containment. On a signal the registered root key and its children are frozen for 15) Tj
T*
(minutes. Unregistered callers are never acted on.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SCOPE AND LIMITATIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Same-author scripted synthetic lab scenarios. Not a benchmark and not a measure of any) Tj
T*
(product in the wild.) Tj
T*
(- Group results are the outcome of the repository's own defence tests; each count traces to) Tj
T*
(a named pytest node id.) Tj
T*
(- The real-model loopback archive figure \(2 of 13 non-control runs\) is a separate) Tj
T*
(measurement and is never pooled with these results.) Tj
T*
(- Latency is measured CPU time per in-process evaluate_call decision on one machine. The 2) Tj
T*
(ms figure is a reference target, not a guarantee.) Tj
T*
(- The gateway binds 127.0.0.1 by default. Freeze actions apply for 15 minutes to registered) Tj
T*
(lab keys only.) Tj
T*
(- ATLAS technique labels are approximate.) Tj
T*
(- A passing audit-chain verify means the log is internally consistent. It is not a) Tj
T*
(certification and not a penetration test.) Tj
T*
(- Group counts show that the guards behave as their own tests specify. They are not an) Tj
T*
(estimate of recall against an unknown adversary.) Tj
T*
(- Benign workflows were written by the same author and are few; the denial rate is a smoke) Tj
T*
(check, not a false-positive rate for real deployments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
